WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.568
-Thank you so much
for coming on the show, buddy.

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:03.902
I appreciate it.
-No problem.

00:00:03.902 --> 00:00:05.705
-Kevin, I hear you have a game
that you want to play.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:08.441
-Yes, man, I do have a game
that I want to play.

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:09.976
It's actually one of the games
from my show,

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:11.711
"Celebrity Game Face,"
that we were talking about,

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:15.748
and it's a game called
"Fill in the Blank." Okay?

00:00:15.748 --> 00:00:18.685
♪♪

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.486
All right, so, look,
this is a game that tests

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:22.455
how well two people
know each other.

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:25.658
Jimmy, I feel like you and I,
we know each other very well.

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:28.627
-Long time.
-So I'll ask a personal question

00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:31.030
and then, you should have
a whiteboard in front of you.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:33.466
-Mm-hmm. Yes, I do.
-You'll write down how you think

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:35.201
the other person will answer,
right?

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:38.771
And then, at the end of it,
we'll say our own actual answer,

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:41.908
and if it's what we wrote,
if it matches, we get a point.

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:43.375
It make sense?
-Love it.

00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:44.543
Very simple.
-Yeah.

00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:46.046
We're gonna be besties
after this.

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:49.115
-All right, I think so.
Okay. You ready?

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:52.986 line:0%
The first question is, if I
could change one thing about me,

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:57.023 line:0%
it would be my...
-Okay. And this is...

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:59.392 line:0%
-Think about it.
-I'm answering for you?

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:03.029 line:0%
-Yeah.
And I'm answering for you.

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:04.497 line:0%
Okay?
All right?

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:06.098 line:0%
I got it.
I got you.

00:01:06.098 --> 00:01:08.000 line:0%
Okay.
There we go.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.937 line:0%
-So if I could change
one thing about Kevin Hart,

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:13.706 line:0%
yes, about yourself...
-Yeah.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.508 line:0%
-...Kevin Hart,
so I'm answering for you, yeah.

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:17.643 line:0%
So what would be your answer?

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:19.311 line:0%
-Okay. You ready?
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:22.815 line:0%
-3, 2...

00:01:22.815 --> 00:01:24.684 line:0%
My nose.
Yeah.

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:26.685 line:0%
-Oh.
-What'd you say?

00:01:26.685 --> 00:01:29.121 line:0%
Size of my -- no.
No, Jimmy.

00:01:29.121 --> 00:01:31.891 line:0%
My nose.
That didn't -- my nose.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:35.361 line:0%
-Sorry.
You would change your nose?

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:36.929 line:0%
-Well, just, you know,
not change it,

00:01:36.929 --> 00:01:38.097 line:0%
but I'm just saying, like,
there's times

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:39.999 line:0%
when it flares a little bit.
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:43.068 line:0%
-It gets a little --
It gets a little excessive.

00:01:43.068 --> 00:01:44.603 line:0%
I thought that you thought
that I was probably gonna say

00:01:44.603 --> 00:01:47.040 line:0%
my height, and that's not --
I wouldn't change my height.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.108 line:0%
I'm fine with that.
Right?

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:50.810 line:0%
That's no points.
-I would never do that.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.011
So no points for that.
All right, I just took a guess.

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:53.279
-I thought you knew me.

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:55.948
And I've complained
about my nose to you before.

00:01:55.948 --> 00:01:58.384
There was times where I was
like, "I'm smelling everything.

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:01.954
I just wish I had
a little less nostril."

00:02:01.954 --> 00:02:04.290
Remember I told you that?
I thought you'd remember that.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:08.861
-What do you think I would
change about myself?

00:02:08.861 --> 00:02:10.396
-If I could write it down?
You want me to write down

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:11.530
what you would change
about yourself?

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:13.399
-Yeah.
-Easy. Easy.

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:14.734
-Really?
-Easy. Yes.

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:17.003
-Change about myself...
-Got it.

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:19.138
-1, 2, 3.

00:02:19.138 --> 00:02:20.473
-Forehead.
-I'm too nice.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:22.275
-Your forehead.
No?

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:23.876
Wait a second, Jimmy.
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:25.310
No, Jimmy.
-Why do you think

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:27.947
I want to change my forehead?
-Because it's so big.

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:30.149
I thought that you didn't --
It's a lot of space.

00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:32.017
-Same size as your forehead.

00:02:32.017 --> 00:02:33.886
-Yeah, but we got two
different-shaped heads.

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:37.423
You got a lot of travel space.
-I'm Irish.

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:38.691
-Yeah, that's what I'm saying.

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:41.093
I thought you wanted
to condense it a little bit.

00:02:41.093 --> 00:02:43.595
-I'd never heard of someone
condensing their forehead.

00:02:43.595 --> 00:02:45.598
-All right. Well, then,
maybe I guessed that wrong.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:47.867
I assumed, because of
that space in there,

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:49.469
that you would've wanted
to take it out.

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:52.338
It's like closing up a highway.
-This --

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:56.442
-[ Laughs ]
-This is...

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:58.211
This is the last question.

00:02:58.211 --> 00:03:01.480
This one is for all the marbles.

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:03.783
This is to say
are we best friends

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:05.818
or we not best friends, okay?
-Okay.

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:08.020
-We're gonna get this one.
-Yep.

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.056
-Go for it.
-All right. Are you ready?

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:11.290
-Yeah.
-I have a question.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:14.326 line:0%
The person I would want
to play me in a movie

00:03:14.326 --> 00:03:18.063 line:0%
about my life is...
Oh, this is good.

00:03:18.063 --> 00:03:20.199 line:0%
This is good.
All right? And this is me.

00:03:20.199 --> 00:03:22.268 line:0%
Come on.
You got to think about this.

00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:25.438 line:0%
You got to really
think about this, okay?

00:03:25.438 --> 00:03:27.640 line:0%
-Mm-hmm.
-All right. You ready?

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.910 line:0%
-To play you in a movie.
I know who it is.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.813 line:0%
Count of three -- 1, 2, 3.

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:35.915 line:0%
Webster.
Emmanuel Lewis.

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:37.616 line:0%
What?
-No, man.

00:03:37.616 --> 00:03:39.885 line:0%
Denzel.
-Dude, well, Emmanuel --

00:03:39.885 --> 00:03:41.254 line:0%
I'm just sayin' --
-Denzel.

00:03:41.254 --> 00:03:43.655 line:0%
No, man.
What are you --

00:03:43.655 --> 00:03:46.259 line:0%
-Dude, he's funny.
He can act.

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:48.027 line:0%
He can act.
He can do anything.

00:03:48.027 --> 00:03:51.697 line:0%
He can do anything.
I guessed, yes, Denzel, as well.

00:03:51.697 --> 00:03:54.700 line:0%
-Denzel, man.
-That's what I meant to write.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:56.102 line:0%
That's what I meant to write.
-Yeah, I need somebody

00:03:56.102 --> 00:03:58.770
that can really grasp
my death and my life

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:00.506
in a performance, man.

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:02.241
-I love you, buddy.
Thank you for playing this.

00:04:02.241 --> 00:04:03.976
That is how you play
"Fill in my Blank."

00:04:03.976 --> 00:04:05.444
-Yes.
-Give it up for Kevin Hart.

00:04:05.444 --> 00:04:09.248
His show, "Celebrity Game Face"
is on Thursday at 10:00 p.m.

00:04:09.248 --> 00:04:10.750
on the E! Network.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.050
We'll be right back
with more "Tonight Show."

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:13.553
Great to see you, bud.

